# From the Navigator, Ctrl+T opens the Flagged view in a new pane; flagging a task with ! in the outline pane lists it there.
file <<END
Home:
	- Fix the shelf @flag
	- Pay rent
END
keys <C-g>
see Navigator
type flag
keys <C-t>
see 󰈻 Flagged
see - Fix the shelf 󰈻  Home
keys g1 G !
see - Pay rent 󰈻  Home
quit
saved <<END
Home:
	- Fix the shelf @flag
	- Pay rent @flag
END
